petrus-viewer-server
Copyright 2026 Seasoned

This package is a Haskell port of the non-UI parts of petrus-viewer
(https://github.com/henriquebastos/petrus-viewer), pinned under
upstream/petrus-viewer. It follows the behavior of bin/petrus.mjs,
server/*.mjs, the dev-server plugins in vite.config.ts, and
src/agent/protocol.ts, and its test suite ports the upstream server tests.
